Exhale a mist of lingering acid, dealing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; MP 100)] acid damage that can critical in a radius of [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] each turn for [6, 6, 7, 7, 7 (MP 10-100)] turns.

Enemies in this mist will be corroded for [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] turns, lowering their Accuracy, their Armour and their Defense by [11, 14, 17, 20, 22 (TL1-5; MP 100)].

The damage and duration will increase with your Mindpower, and the radius will increase with talent level.

Each point in acid drake talents also increases your acid resistance by 1%.
